nits, accepts delivery in 12.0 to 14.0 hours, pays $2936.489 per unit, and settles invoices in 12.0 to 54.0 days; here, any unmet demand is backordered rather than lost. Structurally, all 8 suppliers connect into the Manufacturing Site, and finished medical_device units move from the Manufacturing Site to the Regional Depot. The model runs in hours over a 730-hour horizon, with 10 replications.

