e purchases camera every 31.0 weeks, with demand ranging from 2200249.0 units to 2440676.0 units, customer lead times between 13.0 weeks and 29.0 weeks, and a pure lost-sales policy if inventory is unavailable. The camera price is $3818.507 per unit, with payment due in 38.0 weeks. Broadcom Limited takes GPU with order arrivals somewhere between 35.0 weeks and 49.0 weeks, a fixed requirement of 4618894.0 units, and a 27.0-week customer lead time. Here the business ships what it has and backorders the remainder. GPU sells at $3995.196 per unit, and Broadcom pays between 52.0 weeks and 58.0 weeks later. Overall, the model runs in weeks over a 500-week horizon, with the supplier base connected into Plant A and the finished output flowing onward to the Storage Facility.

