 1 day and faces a shortage cost of $19.232 per unit. Solar_panel stock is also checked every 1 day, with a holding cost of $5.546 per unit and a shortage cost of $44.742 per unit. On the demand side, Broadcom Limited buys SoC, placing orders with exponentially distributed interarrival times averaging 42 days. Order size is typically 3157652.0 units with variability of about 192914.0 units, delivery to the customer takes 19 days, and the selling price is $146.464 per unit. If inventory is short, available units ship immediately and the remainder is backordered, and Broadcom pays 56 days after delivery. TechCorp purchases solar_panel with customer arrivals averaging 59 days, and each order is a constant 2669767.0 units. Delivery lead time to TechCorp ranges from 8 to 17 days, the sales price is $2815.693 per unit, and payment comes in between 32 and 34 days. Their orders follow the same partial-fulfillment backorder approach, so whatever is on hand ships first and the balance waits for replenishment.

